VulkanMod NeoForge Unofficial Fork

This project is an unofficial modified fork of xCollateral/VulkanMod:
https://github.com/xCollateral/VulkanMod

The fork was modified on 2026-06-19 for Minecraft 1.21.1 NeoForge compatibility, release metadata cleanup, and local compatibility fixes.

Original project authorship and contribution credit belongs to xCollateral and VulkanMod contributors.
Fork maintenance credit: Rindw.

